# A contact that goes out of range: the message is retried, then marked failed.
node Erin 6
as Erin advert
wait 3000
key menu
key down 3
key enter
wait 2000
unlink Cardputer Erin
hold esc 900
key right
key enter
type Are you there?
key enter
wait 1000
expect status pending
wait 30000
expect status failed
shot dm-failed
